# Files and folders Docker should NOT copy into the backend image.
# **/ at the start means "in any folder", so these rules reach inside services/api/.

# Python's compiled-code caches: regenerated automatically, not source code.
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc

# Environment files: may contain secrets and must never go into an image.
**/.env*

# Tests: the container runs the API, not the test suite.
**/tests

# Log files: not code, so they're not needed.
**/*.log

# Your local Python packages folder: the container installs its own.
**/.venv